#problem(1)[
  A grayscale image has the following histogram:
 
  #image("pics/1.png",width: 75%)
  
  Use Otsu’s method to compute the optimal threshold that maximizes the between-class variance.
]

#SOLUTION

图像的总像素数 $N = 40 + 20 + 50 + 30 + 10 + 30 + 10 + 10 = 200$。

计算各灰度级 $i$ 的概率 $p_i = n_i / N$：
- $p_0 = 40/200 = 0.20$
- $p_1 = 20/200 = 0.10$
- $p_2 = 50/200 = 0.25$
- $p_3 = 30/200 = 0.15$
- $p_4 = 10/200 = 0.05$
- $p_5 = 30/200 = 0.15$
- $p_6 = 10/200 = 0.05$
- $p_7 = 10/200 = 0.05$

计算全局均值 $m_G$：
$ m_G = sum_(i=0)^7 i dot p_i = 2.65 $

Otsu方法最大化类间方差 $sigma_B^2(k)$，公式为：
$ sigma_B^2(k) = (m_G P_1(k) - m(k))^2 / (P_1(k)(1 - P_1(k))) $
其中 $P_1(k) = sum_(i=0)^k p_i$ 是类1的累积概率，$m(k) = sum_(i=0)^k i dot p_i$ 是类1的累积均值。

遍历可能的阈值 $k$ ($0 <= k <= 6$)：
- $k=0$: $P_1 = 0.20$, $m = 0$, $sigma_B^2(0) = (2.65 times 0.2 - 0)^2 / (0.2 times 0.8) = 0.53^2 / 0.16 approx 1.756$
- $k=1$: $P_1 = 0.30$, $m = 0.1$, $sigma_B^2(1) = (2.65 times 0.3 - 0.1)^2 / (0.3 times 0.7) = 0.695^2 / 0.21 approx 2.300$
- $k=2$: $P_1 = 0.55$, $m = 0.6$, $sigma_B^2(2) = (2.65 times 0.55 - 0.6)^2 / (0.55 times 0.45) = 0.8575^2 / 0.2475 approx 2.971$
- **$k=3$: $P_1 = 0.70$, $m = 1.05$, $sigma_B^2(3) = (2.65 times 0.7 - 1.05)^2 / (0.7 times 0.3) = 0.805^2 / 0.21 approx 3.086$**
- $k=4$: $P_1 = 0.75$, $m = 1.25$, $sigma_B^2(4) = (2.65 times 0.75 - 1.25)^2 / (0.75 times 0.25) = 0.7375^2 / 0.1875 approx 2.901$
- $k=5$: $P_1 = 0.90$, $m = 2.0$, $sigma_B^2(5) = (2.65 times 0.9 - 2.0)^2 / (0.9 times 0.1) = 0.385^2 / 0.09 approx 1.647$
- $k=6$: $P_1 = 0.95$, $m = 2.3$, $sigma_B^2(6) = (2.65 times 0.95 - 2.3)^2 / (0.95 times 0.05) = 0.2175^2 / 0.0475 approx 0.996$

最大类间方差出现在 $k = 3$ 时。因此，最佳阈值为 $T = 3$。

